OL,3,GNEWSAReference for rapist 'a factor' in
OL,4,Anot seeking re-election, says Tierney
OL,5,
OL,6,FA veteran SDLP councillor has said the
OL,7,Fcontroversy over a court reference he
OL,8,Fprovided for an Irish soldier convicted
OL,9,Fof rape was "a factor" in his decision
OL,10,Fnot to seek re-election in 2027.
OL,12,FBrian Tierney announced on Wednesday
OL,13,Fthat he would stand down next year from
OL,14,FDerry City and Strabane District
OL,15,FCouncil.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
