OL,3,GNEWSAReference for rapist 'a factor' in
OL,4,Anot seeking re-election, says Tierney
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes more than a year after he was
OL,7,Fsuspended by his party and lost the
OL,8,Fparty whip after providing a court
OL,9,Freference for Kielan Mooney, who was
OL,10,Fjailed for eight and a half years for
OL,11,Fraping a woman who was also serving in
OL,12,Fthe Irish Army.
OL,14,FFollowing his suspension, the SDLP
OL,15,Flaunched an investigation, which
OL,16,Fsubsequently concluded with Tierney's
OL,17,Freinstatement in April 2025.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
